{"title":"Old Ashbelly","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 58 Salamander that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/old-ashbelly\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/old-ashbelly?lv=58\">Lv 58</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/old-ashbelly?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/old-ashbelly?lv=63\">Lv 63 <span>8</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/old-ashbelly?lv=58\" title=\"Pick level 58\"><td><b>58</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/old-ashbelly?lv=60\" title=\"Pick level 60\"><td><b>60</b></td><td>455</td><td>37.5</td><td>3,000</td><td class=\"muted\">1,365 · 52.5 · 9,000</td><td>4</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/old-ashbelly?lv=63\" title=\"Pick level 63\"><td><b>63</b></td><td>476</td><td>39.2</td><td>3,150</td><td class=\"muted\">1,428 · 54.9 · 9,450</td><td>8</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 3 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 3 recorded drops, 786 total, 233–279 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×233–279</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bones\" title=\"Bones - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c29e1ebe544dbfedca68.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bones</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"salamander-crest\" title=\"Salamander Crest - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/2b93fad57bcaa0db1d86.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Salamander Crest</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonhide-head\" title=\"Dragonhide Head - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/8aff54adaf9a41658e77.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonhide Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-head\" title=\"Dragonscale Head - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/756e510937a28ef5481b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gravewrap-arms\" title=\"Gravewrap Arms - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/12067670c90381512ea9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gravewrap Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-torso\" title=\"Dragonscale Torso - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/325f7365ef8121c29d02.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Molten Heart</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 12</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6301\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Salamander: <a href=\"#/monster/ember-salamander\">Ember Salamander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(59)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cinder-salamander\">Cinder Salamander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/salamander-brood-mother\">Salamander Brood Mother</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/magma-salamander\">Magma Salamander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(63)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/c305ad0ebcabb8388b4a.svg\" alt=\"Old Ashbelly\"></div><h3>Old Ashbelly</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>58 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 60–63)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Salamander</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>burn · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>423</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>36.4</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2900</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>3.36</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>3 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}